# Workspace build artifacts (a single target/ at the root serves both crates).
/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Both crates are zero-dependency libraries; the lockfile carries no pinning
# value and is regenerated on demand (CI runs `cargo generate-lockfile` where
# needed, e.g. for cargo-audit).
Cargo.lock
.env
.temp/
# Claude Code session-local state (e.g. worktree checkouts created by the
# Workflow tool for parallel agent runs) — never part of the product.
.claude/
